              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bazwakule baliswangaanya a-Jehova kuti bamumanine milimo, kuti baya ndisye izina lya-Jehova akuba balanda bakwe, nkukuti boonse balikasya kusofwaazya buzuba bwa-Sabata akujatisya cizuminano cangu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.6",
