        {
          "text": "nzoobaleta kucilundu cangu cisalala akubasekelezya muŋanda yangu yakukomba. Zituuzyo zyabo azipaizyo zyabo zyoonse ziyootambulika acipaililo cangu, nkaambo iŋanda yangu iyootegwa niŋanda yakukombela yamisyobo yoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
